# UI only: no days advanced, no trades. Works in any city with a Stock Exchange.
name the Stock Monitor button opens a see-through list of every listed stock; filters and sort work; nothing spills out
monitor close
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorButton
wait 1
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulStockMonitor
expect-text FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorTitle Stock Monitor
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorClose
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorSettings
expect-text FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorFooter Daily close
expect-text FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorSort Sort:
expect-no-overflow FinanceOverhaulStockMonitor
expect-text FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorSymbol-CHC CHC
capture stock-monitor-list
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorFilter-Portfolio
wait 1
expect-no-overflow FinanceOverhaulStockMonitor
capture stock-monitor-portfolio
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorSort
expect-text FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorSort Sort:
cleanup:
# four sort clicks in all: the player's saved sort is back where it was
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorSort
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorSort
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorSort
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorFilter-All
click FinanceOverhaulStockMonitorClose
